---
description: Keep README and docs in sync with user-facing code changes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Docs and README Sync

- After every code change, verify whether user-facing behavior, setup, commands, configuration, defaults, or workflows changed.
- If any of the above changed, update `README.md` and any relevant docs in the same change.
- Keep docs updates surgical and directly tied to the code diff; avoid unrelated rewrites.
- If no docs update is needed, explicitly confirm why in the final response.
- Do not finish a task with stale examples, outdated flags, or mismatched terminology between code and docs.
